# Trivy exceptions for the Caddy edge image only (passed via `trivyignores` on
# the "Scan Caddy edge image" CI step; other images keep the full gate).
#
# CVE-2026-116587 — go-jose/v3 3.0.5, DoS via crafted RSA parameters in JWKs.
# No fixed release exists. Caddy pulls it through caddypki (smallstep), which
# this deployment never configures: no acme_server, tls internal or
# local_certs. The ACME client that obtains public certificates does not use
# go-jose. Remove this entry as soon as a fixed go-jose/v3 or a Caddy release
# without it is available; the expiry forces a review either way.
CVE-2026-116587 exp:2027-02-08
